8 has a few lines repeated between `declaration` and `canonical_solution`\r\n\r\nThe declaration is \r\n```\r\n...\r\nstring decode_cyclic(string s){ \r\n   int l=s.length();\r\n    int num=(l+2)/3;\r\n    string x,output;\r\n    int i;\r\n    for (i=0;i*3<l;i++)\r\n    {\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe solution is \r\n```\r\n    int l=s.length();\r\n    int num=(l+2)/3;\r\n    string x,output;\r\n    int i;\r\n    for (i=0;i*3<l;i++)\r\n    {\r\n        x=s.substr(i*3,3);\r\n        if (x.length()==3) x=x[2]+x.substr(0,2);\r\n        output=output+x;\r\n    }\r\n    return output;\r\n\r\n\r\n}\r\n\r\n```","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/257/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/257/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[]}